Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to fire it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dare to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:37.91,0:00:42.21,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.8\fad(732,0)\pos(960,935)}~The Dawn of an Adventure~
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.91,0:00:42.21,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(732,0)\t(690,732,\1a&H00&)\pos(960,935)}~The Dawn of an Adventure~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a small seaport village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.95,0:00:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the past year or so, a pirate\Nship has been anchored at the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soft wind from the east blows gently\Nover this peaceful, sleepy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.59,0:01:02.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(1442.5,655)\fad(278,0)\blur0.5\bord2.25\fscx85\fscy90\c&H000000&\3c&H191920&\1a&HFF&\t(237,278,\1a&H00&)}Monkey D. Luffy\NVillage Boy
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.59,0:01:02.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(1442.5,655)\fad(278,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx85\fscy90\4a&HFF&}Monkey D. Luffy\NVillage Boy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding around, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch, I'll prove it to ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go ahead, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure what you're\Nplanning to do, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, drink up! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's drink to Luffy's courage and\Nour great journey on the theme!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't hurt at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lie if I've ever heard one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not scared of\Ngetting hurt again, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.89,0:01:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta take me with\Nyou on your next voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna be a pirate like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, as if you\Ncould ever be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're gonna fare too\Nwell at sea if you sink like an anchor.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.22,0:01:43.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(452,655)\fad(275,0)\blur0.5\bord2.25\fscx95\fscy100\c&H000000&\3c&H191920&\1a&HFF&\t(234,275,\1a&H00&)}"Red-Haired" Shanks\NPirate Captain
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.22,0:01:43.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(452,655)\fad(275,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx95\fscy100\4a&HFF&}"Red-Haired" Shanks\NPirate Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay as long as\NI don't fall overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.49,0:01:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm a\Nreally good fighter, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got lots of training!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, when I punch people,\Nit's like firing a pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you making fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:01:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be in such a sour mood, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still young!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And being a pirate's\Nmore fun than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get to travel across the endless sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.57,0:02:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discovering new places all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're as free as can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you clowns\Ndidn't teach him that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know it's true, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can take him on one little voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, but one of you gets left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to drinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put you guys on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying, you're much too\Nyoung to try and strike out your seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can ask me about it in ten\Nyears and maybe I'll reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid shakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that little!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.91,0:02:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink some juice, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates don't drink juice, big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, I'm tired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you have to try to understand\Nhow the boss feels. Mr. First Mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.71,0:03:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is the captain of a\Ntough-as-nails pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he knows more than anybody how\Ndangerous this kind of life can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he told you not to come along with us\Nbecause he didn't want to break your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just making fun of me\Nbecause he thinks I'm a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Anchor. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're having fun as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get such a kick out of\Ngiving this kid a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, would you like\Nto order some food too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it on my treasure tab, kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treasure tab again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that does qualify\Nas stealing. Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I become a pirate and\Nfind a bunch of treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pay back every last bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shanks! Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much longer are you gonna be here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not too sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe the plan we decided on was to\Ngo on a couple more voyages then head
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out towards the north after we're done\Nwith that. Only a couple more trips, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay then i can practice my swimming while
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're here that's a good\Nidea knock yourself out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excuse us so these are what pass for\Npirates here looks awfully sad to me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, we're mountain bandits.\NBut... we didn't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to tear your place apart we'll\Njust take some booze i'm so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorry sir but we're actually\Nfresh out of alcohol for the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,moment huh those pirates seem\Nto be drinking though is that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,water no that was the last bit\Nof what i had stuck up well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is a problem isn't it it\Nlooks like my friends and i
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drank the place dry before you\Ngentlemen came in. Sorry. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can have this one if you like\Nit hasn't even been opened yet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how dare you can you not see\Nwho you're talking to you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know damn well that won't\Neven be enough for a nightcap
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh now the floor's all wet\Nand sticky. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pal i've got a bounty of 8\Nmillion berries on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've killed 56 people, and all of\Nthem were mouthy fools like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.21,0:05:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd watch my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since we're in the mountains and you're\Non the sea, maybe we won't meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the mess, Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you got a rag?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you like to clean so much, I think\Nyou might find this mess more fulfilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll see you weaklings another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Captain Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never been better, Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Fall really got you good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have stood up to him, Shanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.67,0:06:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't cool at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can laugh over something\Nlike that, then you're not a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a real pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.49,0:06:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Luffy, I know how you feel, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all the guy did was\Nspill a little booze on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth getting so upset about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's he stretchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Gum-Gum fruit we looted!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was right in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just eat something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.61,0:07:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tasted gross, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gum-Gum fruit is one of\Nthe legendary devil fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes your body turn into rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you've lost the ability\Nto swim for the rest of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fish Guy, can I have a fishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you missed out on another\Nbig adventure with the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's laid out a rubber now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more fun than going\Non a voyage anyway. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew's been out at\Nsea for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you missed them. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still upset with those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought Shanks and his\Ncrew were cool pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it turns out they're\Nall totally wimpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think being able to laugh after somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humiliates you like those\Nbandits did is cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, Monk, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes a man's gotta\Nstand up and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't get it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like those damn\Npirates aren't here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.49,0:08:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in the neighborhood, so we\Nthought we'd stop in for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring the booze!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neo, please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Makino? It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid is a freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See your side for last time, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:09:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much money we could\Nget if we sold him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine I don't think I said\Nanything to offend you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a child I don't\Nintend to fight you and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even pay you to stop\Nthis. Just let him live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, senior citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to you to be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat's already made me angry, so not\Neven your pitiful prayers can save him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That rubber face of yours was\Nreal entertaining for a sec,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now all I want to do is bash it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys don't fight fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scum! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget selling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on him, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody was at the port to greet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured something must be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mountain bandits again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, you're here! Hey, Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't you say before that your punches
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were as deadly as getting\Nshot with a pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shove off already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd best leave before\Nyou get hurt take one step
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,closer and my friend here's\Ngonna blow your head clean off
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear what the man said\Ndo you feel like dying today, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now that you've drawn your pistol\Ndo you plan to actually use it boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding it ain't I what I'm trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell you is the guns\Naren't for making threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're made for actions
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these bastards fight dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, were you expecting saints?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think\Nyou're dealing with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case it wasn't obvious, you fellows\Nhave picked a fight with a crew of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.41,0:11:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't about you, so\Ntake your crew and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm sprayed with alcohol or doused\Nwith food, hell, even if I'm spit on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most of the time I'll\Nlaugh it off and forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, regardless of what\Nyour reasoning may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you hurt a friend of mine, you\Ncan believe you're gonna pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show these whips a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get too cocky. Stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanted to fight us, you should have\Nbrought a warship or something bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid was the one who\Nattacked us first, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, you're still\Na wanted man, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.09,0:12:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A smoke screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap, I let the bandit take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use freaking out over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find him in no\Ntime, I swear. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I made a clean getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got no need for you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you, Root. Damn it! I suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are worthless bandits,\Nbut I still couldn't get one hit in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.71,0:12:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, did you see the\Nlooks on their faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All pirates are nothing but\Ncowards and weaklings. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of them like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take back what you said\Nabout Shakes and his crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jake, you found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in your debt, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Machine told me about\Nhow you stood up for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how you were willing to fight\Nand put yourself on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you can't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy learned many\Nimportant things that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The harshness of the sea,\Nhis own powerlessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and most importantly, the\Ngreatness of a man called Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when young Luffy\Nresolved with all his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would become like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinx!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really about to\Nleave the village for good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's time for us to part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you'll miss me, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm not gonna\Nbeg to come with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I'm gonna become\Na pirate all on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good, because I wouldn't\Nbring you with me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you'll never make\Nit as a pirate, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll round up a crew that's\Nevery bit as good as yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll find the\Nworld's greatest treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Planning to outdo me, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.85,0:16:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.29,0:16:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I'll leave this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means more to me than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you become a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.37,0:16:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really does have potential. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He reminds me of myself\Nback when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One decade later, Luffy's own pirate\Nadventure began at the very same port.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.63,0:16:52.72,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(990,885)\fad(357,0)\blur0.5\bord2.25\fscx120\fscy125\c&H000000&\3c&H191920&\1a&HFF&\t(316,357,\1a&H00&)}Ten Years Later
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.63,0:16:52.72,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(990,885)\fad(357,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx120\fscy125\4a&HFF&}Ten Years Later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Luffy's finally leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Becoming a pirate is a great\Ndishonor to our village!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't ask for a better day for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's this big guy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I've been training a\Nlot over the past 10 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.63,0:17:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PISTOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Outta T .J., you stupid fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm setting out to become\NKing of the Pirates! We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are!

